  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg/Rendering] Heap: transparent geometry renders transparent again — the multi-page `HeapRenderObject` bundle (0024) hid each draw's `IsTransparent` from the OIT router (`TransparencyRenderTask` type-tests `RenderObject`), so heapified transparent buckets fell into the opaque pass; `HeapRenderObject` now exposes `IsTransparent` and the wrapper routes the bundle through all three OIT passes (transforming each inner draw, re-bundling with the same derives). Regression since 0024.",
